window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>An omega who knows her worth<br> The alphas who desperately want her<br> And a black market auction to sell her to the highest bidder.</p> <p>Turning 30 and being unmated is frowned upon in my community, but I’m not settling for just any old pack.</p> <p>When I start to get broody, I know it’s time to claim a pack to share my nest with.</p> <p>Without time to waste, I enter myself into a black market auction where the highest bidder gets this omega. I know what I’m worth and the alphas know I’ll bring them to their knees.</p> <p>But I’m in no way prepared for the all-out bidding war, where rival packs will do anything claim me.</p> <p>Will my soul be torn apart in this battle of the alphas or will I find my ever after?</p> <p>This is a non-shifting, reverse harem Omegaverse stand-alone with possible content warnings. Please view the Preface regarding these. Set in England.</p>"; 
